[[File:CN Gogan.jpg|thumb|''S. napaulensis'' in Nagarkot, Nepal]]

'''''Saurauia napaulensis''''' is a small to medium tree. Leaves 20–35&nbsp;cm by 6.5–12&nbsp;cm, apex acuminate, base rounded, margins with fine teeth; 30-35 pairs of straight prominent veins. Flowers about 1.5&nbsp;cm in diameter, pink, in branched axillary inflorescences. Fruit a globose berry, about 8&nbsp;mm in diameter.<ref name="test">[http://www.forestrynepal.org/resources/trees/saurauia-napaulensis], Saurauia napaulensis.</ref>

